---
---
<header class="masthead">
  <div class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--amber-mid)">Depository Receipt · Office of the Vault Keeper</div>
  <h1 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(34px,9vw,64px);line-height:.95;margin:14px 0 4px">
    The Bead <em style="color:var(--amber-mid);font-style:italic">Reserve</em>
  </h1>
  <p style="color:var(--text-soft);font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,19px)">
    The Bead Reserve maintains <b>full physical collateralization</b> of every outstanding
    BEADZ against a monitored reserve of glass seed beads, held in a sealed jar and observed
    continuously by camera. Supply was minted once at genesis and fixed permanently.
    One (1) BEADZ is entitled to one (1) bead.
  </p>
  <p class="mono" style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px">
    <a href="/whitepaper.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The full terms are set out in the whitepaper&nbsp;↗</a>
  </p>
</header>

<style>
  /* Bracket-frame header borrowed from the half-built-robots blog header
     (.site-header-wrapper): 2px rules top and bottom, with 2px vertical accent
     lines at the edges that are solid at the corners and fade out toward the
     middle. */
  .masthead {
    position: relative;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line);
    padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 34px) clamp(20px, 3vw, 30px);
    margin: 8px 0 30px;
  }
  .masthead::before,
  .masthead::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    width: 2px;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      var(--line) 0%,
      transparent 35%,
      transparent 65%,
      var(--line) 100%
    );
  }
  .masthead::before { left: 0; }
  .masthead::after { right: 0; }
</style>
